 *
 * Grows ONE server's own root disk by N GB — the plan's CPU/RAM are untouched.
 * Payment already happened at enqueue time (lib/disk-expand.ts applyDiskExpand),
 * so this handler trusts `payload.addGB` / `payload.targetExtraDiskGB` and is
 * responsible only for delivering the space.
