 *   1. read the VM config, work out the CURRENT scsi0 size
 *   2. if it is already >= the target, SKIP Proxmox entirely (idempotent retry)
 *      otherwise PUT .../resize with size=+<delta>G  (Proxmox only ever grows)
 *   3. online-grow the guest: rescan the device, growpart the root partition,
 *      then resize2fs / xfs_growfs / btrfs resize depending on the fs type
